WEBVTT

NOTE
English narration for the portfolio demo. Timed to the rendered voice.

1
00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.481
End-to-end checks fail quietly.

2
00:00:02.481 --> 00:00:03.953
A page is not ready.

3
00:00:03.953 --> 00:00:06.075
Two workers share one account.

4
00:00:06.075 --> 00:00:08.224
The report never leaves the runner.

5
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:13.406
A headed Playwright run on the public
practice shop.

6
00:00:13.406 --> 00:00:17.885
Page objects open a product, add it to the
cart, and read the total.

7
00:00:17.885 --> 00:00:19.630
The data is synthetic.

8
00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.221
Pytest writes JUnit.

9
00:00:24.221 --> 00:00:27.333
The report turns that file into HTML.

10
00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:29.234
A dashboard lists the run.

11
00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:33.922
The framework publishes that HTML through
S3 and CloudFront.

12
00:00:33.922 --> 00:00:35.341
Slack gets the link.

13
00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.622
GitLab CI on Kubernetes.

14
00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.405
Post-deploy and nightly.

15
00:00:40.405 --> 00:00:42.214
pytest-xdist in parallel.

16
00:00:42.214 --> 00:00:43.909
Scarce accounts stay locked.

17
00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:45.819
Login uses TOTP.

18
00:00:45.819 --> 00:00:47.640
API clients do setup.

19
00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:52.096
I use Chrome DevTools MCP skills while I
write the check.

20
00:00:52.096 --> 00:00:54.830
The test waits until the UI is visible.

21
00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:59.427
Playwright frames, ffmpeg, and edge-tts
finish the cut.
